  '**Its weakness is real and I would still buy it.** ⚠ **And not because forty seconds is not very long.** It is very long, and in a store it is the whole job. **I would buy it because at a gate the forty seconds is time I already had**, and the two situations are not comparable.',
  '**The detail that decided it, and nothing else did.** The hold button. You pull the probe out of the pallet and the figure stays on the screen, so the figure goes on to the gate copy without the probe in my other hand.',
  '**What that is worth, measured.** About fifteen seconds a vehicle and one fewer thing dropped in a wet yard. **Eleven vehicles a morning, which is about three minutes, and I have dropped nothing since March.**',
