out.push(A('Each student reads their chosen last line slower than the rest, then says nothing; the room says what it would do on Monday. ⚠ **Compare the figure with Stage 1\'s** and write both on the board. Close on Jad\'s arithmetic: **four of twenty-six against eleven of fourteen** — and the three smallest-trial endings that produced seven replies between them.'));
