  '**It takes the best part of a minute to settle, and for the first fifteen seconds the reading drifts.** Its weakness is real and I would still buy it — and not because a minute is a short time. A minute is a long time. **I would buy it because at a gate the minute is time I already had, standing there while a driver signs.**',
